{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act52side_level_act52side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act52side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act52side_level_act52side_st02","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"YW-5","storyName":"三岔路口","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"奥卢斯阴谋初露，纳乔救下的一位岛民变为海嗣。卡门与克莱门莎同步信息，告知她船厂才是对打捞计划真正重要的地方。纳乔向审判庭自首。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act52side/level_act52side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act52side_05_beg","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["纳乔","重伤的岛民","焦急的岛民","奥卢斯","海嗣","愤怒的岛民","愤怒的岛民们","惊慌的岛民","“盖乌斯”","恐惧的岛民","坚定的岛民","圣徒卡门","克莱门莎","艾丽妮"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","posfrom":"-180,-10","posto":"-90,-10","duration":"1.2","block":"true","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"-90,-10","posto":"0,-10","duration":"1.2","block":"true","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,-10","posto":"0,-30","duration":"1","block":"true","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_runstop","volume":"1","id":16},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"1","times":"15","duration":"0.3","id":17},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"-0,-30","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"呼……除了被审判庭带走的人，剩下的都在这里了。","id":21},{"type":"charslot","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重伤的岛民","text":"谢、谢谢……","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的岛民","text":"你一个人，救了十四个重伤的同胞？还是背着他们从水路走的……简直是奇迹……","id":25},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奇迹……","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我只是不想看着同胞被落在外面流血而死。为了不被审判庭的人逮捕，很多人躲得很隐蔽。","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"索莱达，我找到你的时候，你腿上的伤看着很重，止血了吗？","id":31},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的岛民","text":"奥卢斯先生已经帮我处理过了，倒是你……","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"焦急的岛民","text":"阿奎拉以前就念叨着你手臂伤得很重根本不适宜下水，现在你不光下了水，还一趟一趟地带了这么多人回来……你也找他处理一下吧？","id":34},{"type":"dialog","id":35},{"type":"charslot","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-20,0","duration":"0.5","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":39},{"type":"charslot","id":40},{"type":"text","text":"疲惫的年轻人躲开了同伴触碰自己的手，就像是害怕自己会伤害她一样。","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不用担心，索莱达。我的手臂，已经找奥卢斯先生治疗过了。","id":43},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"charslot","id":45},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":46},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":47},{"type":"background","id":48},{"type":"charslot","id":49},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":50},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":52},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"4","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","block":"false","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":55},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"不论你如何选择，纳乔，我向你保证，我都可以治好你的手臂。","id":56,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":57},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"治好我的手臂……","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奥卢斯先生，互助会的大家已经没办法回头了，是吗？","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"你可以试着说服他们，但会很难。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":63},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我明白。我曾无数次劝说鲁菲纳奶奶不要再做危险的事，可她还是会在夜晚离开。","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":65},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奶奶做的事，阿奎拉做的事，在我看来依然是偏激的。","id":66},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"但在加入互助会之后我理解了一件事——我永远是岛民中的一员。我想帮他们，可以我现在的状况……","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#4$1","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奥卢斯先生，您确实能治好我的手吗？","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"好孩子。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我的治疗方式有些特殊，如果你想好了，就跟我来吧。要是治疗过程中感到不适应，你也可以拒绝。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":75},{"type":"dialog","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":79},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":80},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.55","fillto":"0.55","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":81},{"type":"image","image":"74_i05","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.25","yScale":"1.25","x":"-70","fadetime":"0","id":82},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"-55","yTo":"10","xFrom":"-70","xTo":"-100","duration":"15","xScaleFrom":"1.25","yScaleFrom":"1.25","xScaleTo":"1.4","yScaleTo":"1.4","block":"false","id":83},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_monastery_nomal.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":84,"musicid":1},{"type":"text","text":"或许是因为阿奎拉的死让纳乔想起了鲁菲纳奶奶，或许是因为互助会的同胞露出的狂热令他躁动也令他担忧。","id":85},{"type":"dialog","id":86},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":87},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":88},{"type":"text","text":"即便从眼前这个温柔的男人身上感受到了危险的气息，他还是毅然决然地将自己的伤痛交予对方处理。此时他脑中只有一个想法——","id":89},{"type":"text","text":"他不能让同胞们都怀着仇恨和遗憾死去，他想用一双健全的手臂拦住他们或者救下他们，只要奥卢斯能做到，他愿意付出代价。","id":90},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seaborn_wiggle","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":91},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":92},{"type":"text","text":"黏滑的声音传入他的耳朵，他死死盯着工坊的暗处，一个影子悄然立在不远处。它缓慢地、怪异地朝自己靠近。","id":93},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":94},{"type":"dialog","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"那是……","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"curtain","direction":"2","fillfrom":"0.55","fillto":"0.55","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":101},{"type":"curtain","direction":"6","fillfrom":"0.15","fillto":"0.15","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":102},{"type":"image","image":"74_i05","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.2","yScale":"1.2","x":"80","fadetime":"0","id":103},{"type":"imagetween","yFrom":"-30","yTo":"50","duration":"15","block":"false","id":104},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"嘘——","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"你一定会害怕，它就是审判庭写在经卷里的罪孽和怪物，就是你们不被允许靠近大海的唯一原因。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"但放心，这个个体……它是我最满意的作品，是我几十年来所有研究成果的具象显现。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"它不会愤怒、不会争吵、不会流泪、不会施暴，也不会试图把你变成它的同伴。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我篡改了它神经信号的传递逻辑，使它不那么容易受“初生”意志的影响。它还保留着同化其他生物的能力，但不再有那么做的动机。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"当然，“初生”的意志是刻在基因里的，它还是会顽强地试图制造新的神经组织，来替换被我动过手脚的那些……","id":112,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"但只要勤加干预，进程就不会那么快。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"如果你怀疑我的言辞，我们随时可以终止手术。海嗣是凶残的、无法沟通的怪物，这是伊比利亚人的共识——","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不，我可以理解。","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"curtain","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"image","image":"74_i05","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.05","yScale":"1.05","fadetime":"0","id":121},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.2","yScaleFrom":"1.2","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"20","block":"false","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"哦？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我也花了近二十年想向伊比利亚人证明，岛民是无害的，是没有攻击性的……但我的努力还不够，我能做到的太少了。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"请继续手术吧，奥卢斯先生。我总不能在寻求帮助的途中再晕倒一次了。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"text","text":"柔滑的触手攀上纳乔的指尖，本不该有太多触感的假肢正在颤抖。","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"他见过捕鳞人被恐鱼袭击的惨状，他竭力控制着自己不要抽回手，然后——","id":129},{"type":"text","text":"疼痛真的消失了。","id":130},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":132},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":134},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":135},{"type":"image","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seabornactivity_1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","id":141},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"3","times":"30","duration":"1","id":142},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"海嗣","text":"（欣快地翕动薄膜）","id":144},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":146},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"令人赞叹，纳乔，你比我想象中更加镇定。你在无人点拨的情况下，理解了分享的本质。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"分享……奥卢斯先生，您与海嗣为伍，但又不像是癫狂的异教徒，您想要的究竟是什么？","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我想要的，是一个真正的“理想国”。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"playsound","key":"$flashback","volume":"0.8","id":154},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":155},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":156},{"type":"charslot","id":157},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":158},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":159},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":160},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":161},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"纳乔，帮我把绷带再扎紧一点。","id":165},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不能再紧了，盖乌斯，勒得再紧止血效果也不会变好，只会让你疼。","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"但这样就能盖过伤口的疼了。我们的行动不能到此为止……","id":169},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":170},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"你在说什么？现在互助会半数的同胞被审判庭逮捕，街道上巡逻的惩戒军只增不减，我们还有不少伤员，停手吧！","id":172},{"type":"charslot","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"参与行动前我们每个人都立过誓，要让伊比利亚记住我们，要让审判庭和那群羞辱过我们的伊比利亚人后悔。","id":174},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"岛民不是审判庭召之即来挥之即去的工具，我们要让所有伊比利亚人对我们感到恐惧，然后再赢得尊重。","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"还没有到停手的时候……嘶……*伊比利亚粗口*站起来啊盖乌斯，站起来！","id":176},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":178,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":179},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"盖乌斯，冷静一些。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奥卢斯先生，您劝劝他们吧！","id":184},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"同胞们，不甘和怨恨让你们的伤口血流不止，这是你们必须承担的代价，也是警告。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"导师，您了解我们每个人的情况，您知道我们究竟为何反抗。","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"我的孩子被伊比利亚人摔死在干涸的井里，他们想借此平息大海的怒火，增加鳞获……但他们换来的是我的怒火。","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"除了我和妻子安赫拉，谁还会记得这桩恶行，记得我们无辜的孩子？","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"哪怕我失去双腿，我也会敲响仇人的家门；哪怕我失去声音，我也会宣扬他们的恶行！","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"这是你的选择？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"是的。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"也是你们的选择？","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民们","text":"是的。","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"好。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":202},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"奥卢斯先生……？","id":204},{"type":"dialog","id":205},{"type":"charslot","id":206},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":207},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_illusionmagic","volume":"1","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":213},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_bat_act17side_03_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act17side/m_bat_act17side_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":216,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"教堂怎么变成了……","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"教堂是善意的伪装，也是避免审判庭找到互助会的手段。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"现在，信仰无法解决你的问题，我的同胞，而任何选择都需要付出代价。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我可以治好你身体的疼痛，甚至让你遗忘所有经受过的折磨，只要你愿意分享。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"分享？","id":225},{"type":"dialog","id":226},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seabornactivity_1","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":229},{"type":"charslot","id":230},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的岛民","text":"这是什么？！是海里的怪物！导师……不，你是深海教会的人！","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"不要那么紧张，它不会伤害你们，我也不会。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2273_1#1$1","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的岛民","text":"盖乌斯，离那个东西远一点，它会把你吃得什么都不剩！我见过一次……见过一次……","id":236},{"type":"charslot","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"它可以让我重新站起来，去做更多的事，对吗？","id":238},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"是的。但这样，恐怕你以后就很难再去见你的妻子了。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的岛民","text":"在她眼里，孩子死去的那一刻，我也就死了。","id":242},{"type":"dialog","id":243},{"type":"charslot","id":244},{"type":"backgroundtween","image":"74_g7_alsatelier","duration":"20","xScaleTo":"1.18","yScaleTo":"1.18","block":"false","id":245},{"type":"text","text":"一只唐突出现在工坊中的海嗣，一个已经做好决定的阿戈尔人。他们在惊恐、担忧、愤怒、悲哀的人群中，注视着彼此。","id":246},{"type":"text","text":"冷峻严肃的男人绷紧嘴唇，握紧了拳头，努力克制自己颤抖的身体，靠近那只怪物，但房间中的每一个人都清楚，他也在害怕。","id":247},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Chaos","from":"chaos_none","to":"chaos_normal","fadetime":"3","keep":"true","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"就在海嗣触碰男人的一瞬间，他紧绷的身体放松了。他的目光空茫，脸上却露出了笑意，他眼前似乎出现了只有他才能看到的景象。","id":249},{"type":"dialog","id":250},{"type":"bg","duration":"1","from":"0","to":"1","block":"true","id":251},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"70","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":252},{"type":"text","text":"他流下了眼泪，他伸出染血的双臂拥抱了眼前的怪物——就像拥抱自己再也无法拥抱的孩子。","id":253},{"type":"dialog","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":255},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":256},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","glitch":"true","matname":"glitch_none","duration":"0.8","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":258},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seabornactivity_1","id":259},{"type":"glitchtween","slot":"m","glitchto":"bluescreen_middle","duration":"0.5","id":260},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":261},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_signalInterference","layer":"1","id":262},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":263},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_middle","id":264},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":265},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":266},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","id":268},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":269},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"0,0","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","id":272},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":273},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":274},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.9","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":275},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,-50","posto":"0,-50","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0.2","g":"0.2","b":"0.8","fadetime":"0.15","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2272_1#1$1","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"0.95","duration":"2","id":278},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":279},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":280},{"type":"charslot","id":281},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":282},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_seabornactivity_intense","id":283},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","id":284},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1388_1#1$1","glitch":"true","matname":"bluescreen_strong","action":"zoom","poszoom":"0.5,0.5","scale":"1.2","duration":"2.5","id":285},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":286},{"type":"glitchtween","slot":"m","glitchto":"glitch_none","duration":"2","id":287},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","action":"shake","afrom":"1","ato":"1","power":"1.5","times":"60","duration":"2","id":288},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"“盖乌斯”","text":"……","id":290},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1","id":292},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"不对……这不对！你明明说手术是无害的，我明明也还没事，为什么盖乌斯他——","id":293},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":294},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"他依旧是你们的同胞，而且现在他可以站起来，完成他想做的事。","id":295,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":296},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"如果你们也不想因为伤病就止步于此，我可以提供帮助。","id":297,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惊慌的岛民","text":"我不想变成这样……我只是想在这片土地上过得更好一点，而不是……","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恐惧的岛民","text":"就是因为这些怪物我们才会被伊比利亚人唾弃，被视为灾祸的根源！我不能、我不能跟这种东西……","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"坚定的岛民","text":"你们都忘了自己加入互助会最初的目标了吗！我们要让审判庭、让伊比利亚人正视我们的处境，无论用什么方法！","id":301},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#7$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"每个人的选择不同，只有理念相同的人才能结伴而行。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f4/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#2$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"盖乌斯与你索求的不同，手术的结果也就不同。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#5$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我以为你会帮我们，但不是以这种方式……","id":307},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"我会尊重每个人的意愿，纳乔。","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#10$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#9$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"我要离开这里。","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"当然可以，这里的大门永远为每一位疑惑、困苦、向往和平的阿戈尔人打开。","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_941_1#1$1","id":316},{"type":"dialogue","name":"奥卢斯","text":"你可以去做你想做的，任何事。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4a/Avg_avg_npc_941_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","id":318},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"……","id":319},{"type":"dialog","id":320},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":321},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#7$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","id":323},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":324},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":326},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":327},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"bg","duration":"0","from":"1","to":"0","block":"true","id":329},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Chaos","fadetime":"0","amount":"0","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"background","screenadapt":"coverall","id":331},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":334},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_darkness_03_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":335,"musicid":4},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"针对袭击案的收尾工作仍在进行，灯塔供能矩阵还需要时间修复，但民众的惶恐已经逐渐平息。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"我应当感谢你，克莱门莎监事，你为我们找到了遇袭灯塔的位置，避免了诸多损失。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"作为打捞中心的负责人，这是我该做的。","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"况且，您与我都清楚，打捞计划真正的核心，并不在于灯塔。","id":344},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"三十七支守塔队伍，让供能灯塔的重要性不言自明，意图破坏打捞计划的不轨之徒，自然也会将它们视作目标。","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"没有人会意识到一座用来打捞、修复船骸的造船厂，才是计划的核心。港都的中控室，就在那里。","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"导航、动力、通讯——港都作为移动城市的几乎所有功能，都由那里控制。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4d/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"其中最重要的，是一套维系着整个黄金时代几乎所有航海活动的庞大海图系统。","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"它记载着伊比利亚国土上存在过的每一座城镇、每一个港口，也记载着一代代水手在海上发现的每一个岛屿、每一处鳞场。","id":353,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"而如今，审判庭偌大的档案库中，甚至都找不出一张精确、完整的伊比利亚地图。","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"当初岛民带上岸的蓝本，应该已经包含了阿戈尔海图系统的大部分功能。它理应可以接收城市和设施发出的信号，实时标记它们的位置。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"几天后，当港都的中心城区被打捞上岸，它的坐标会在伊比利亚和阿戈尔的海图系统上同时亮起。","id":359},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"是。而在岛民密谋袭击之前，船厂已经接手了能够解除系统权限封锁、重新启动海图的那把“钥匙”——","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"一只属于过去的海嗣。它会留在船厂，凭它体内的炼金术式，维系港都的所有城市功能正常运作。","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"……至少，在我们能够重构港都的所有系统和功能之前。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"所以，您广招船工和制帆匠是为了掩人耳目，让斐戴拉大审判官进驻船厂则是另一重保障。","id":367},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#4$1","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"在灯塔遇袭，审判庭全体出动的时候，她带着自己的队伍坚守船厂。","id":369},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#11$1","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"服从命令是士兵的天职，但我也清楚，看着同僚行动自己却无法支援的感受，对她来说或许很煎熬。","id":371},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","id":372},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"我了解我的学生，她对审判庭过分忠诚。在一切尘埃落定之前，她不会知道自己接手的是什么。","id":373,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#7$1","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"等雷亚-伊比利亚正式恢复使用后，我会向审判庭成员宣布灯火的真相。有朝一日，他们会需要重新用自己的意志点燃灯火。","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/da/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"这不会容易。","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#1$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"现在，克莱门莎监事，尽管我们还需调查岛民袭击行动背后的原因，追查真正的煽动者……","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","focus":"r","name":"avg_npc_447_1#8$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"圣徒卡门","text":"但打捞工程确确实实又推进了一步，我们都可以暂时松一口气了。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2b/Avg_avg_npc_447_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","focus":"l","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#5$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"但愿如此。","id":383},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":387},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":388},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.2","id":390},{"type":"delay","time":"1.2","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"圣徒阁下，克莱门莎监事。","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#1$1","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"据岗哨消息，一名自称参与了灯塔袭击的岛民出现在海边。","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/66/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4009_irene_1#8$1","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"艾丽妮","text":"他想向审判庭……自首。","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_4009_irene_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":397},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"charslot","id":400},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/88/Avg_bg_32_RL2_cliffday.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":402},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sea","volume":"0","channel":"f","loop":"true","id":404},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"f","fadetime":"1","id":405},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":406},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":407,"musicid":5},{"type":"text","text":"岸边黑色的石滩上，海风凄厉。","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"最早，他从这里爬上岸时，站在岸边迎接的是他的奶奶。奶奶总是走得很快，他只能踉跄地跟在后面，回答奶奶无休无止的问话。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"后来，是阿奎拉。阿奎拉会把毛巾裹在他身上，然后两个人在石滩上深一脚浅一脚地往回走，谁也不说一句话。","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"而现在，他数不清在此迎接他的是多少惩戒军的士兵。他们的长戟整整齐齐地指向他，映出的寒光刺得他睁不开眼。","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"那之中，当然也有他熟悉的那个身影。","id":412},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4231_clemnt_1#2$1","duration":"0.8","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":415},{"type":"dialogue","name":"克莱门莎","text":"纳乔……","id":416},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#3$1","id":417},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"抱歉，克莱门莎监事，最近我落下了太多工作。","id":418},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4232_hbound_1#1$1","id":419},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"审判庭的长官们，我自认参与了灯塔袭击。","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"纳乔","text":"只要各位长官能答应我的诉求，我会交代我所知道的一切。","id":421},{"type":"dialog","id":422},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":425},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"f","fadetime":"2","id":426},{"type":"charslot","id":427},{"type":"background","id":428},{"type":"image","id":429}],"characters":["纳乔","重伤的岛民","焦急的岛民","奥卢斯","海嗣","愤怒的岛民","愤怒的岛民们","惊慌的岛民","“盖乌斯”","恐惧的岛民","坚定的岛民","圣徒卡门","克莱门莎","艾丽妮"]}